---
---
<section class="section contact" id="contact">
  <div class="wrap inner">
    <span class="eyebrow">Get in touch</span>
    <h2>Got a project in mind?</h2>
    <p>
      Drop a quick line about what you’re building or fixing. I reply within one working day,
      usually a lot sooner.
    </p>
    <div class="ctas">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="mailto:hello@richiemac.digital">hello@richiemac.digital</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://cal.com/richiemac" rel="noopener">Book a 20-min call</a>
    </div>
    <p class="micro muted">Free site audit on request — I’ll tell you exactly what’s costing you traffic.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .contact {
    background:
      radial-gradient(60% 80% at 50% 0%, rgba(0, 230, 118, 0.10), transparent 70%),
      var(--bg);
  }
  .inner {
    max-width: 720px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
    margin: 1rem 0;
  }
  p {
    color: var(--muted);
    max-width: 56ch;
    margin: 0 auto;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }
  .ctas {
    margin: 2rem 0 1rem;
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .micro { font-size: 0.88rem; }
</style>
